sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as ML Client SDK<br/>(in-cluster pod)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware<br/>(kubernetes-auth)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: Experiment Tracking

    Client->>K8sAPI: Read pod namespace<br/>ServiceAccount token (TLS 1.2+)
    K8sAPI-->>Client: Namespace: {workspace}

    Client->>MLflow: POST /ajax-api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE: {workspace}<br/>Auth: SA Token
    MLflow->>Auth: Validate token + resolve workspace
    Auth->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (SA token validation)<br/>6443/TCP, TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>Auth: Authenticated (namespace confirmed)
    Auth-->>MLflow: Workspace: {namespace}, RBAC: EDIT

    MLflow->>DB: INSERT INTO runs (workspace=...)<br/>5432/TCP, Optional TLS, Password auth
    DB-->>MLflow: Run ID created

    Client->>MLflow: POST /ajax-api/2.0/mlflow/runs/log-batch<br/>Metrics, params, tags
    MLflow->>DB: INSERT INTO metrics, params, tags<br/>(workspace-scoped)
    DB-->>MLflow: OK

    Client->>MLflow: PUT /get-artifact (upload artifact)<br/>Auth: SA Token
    MLflow->>S3: PUT object<br/>443/TCP, TLS 1.2+, AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>MLflow: 200 OK
    MLflow-->>Client: Artifact stored

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: AI Gateway (LLM Proxy)

    participant LLM as LLM Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Client->>MLflow: POST /mlflow/gateway/invocations<br/>Auth: Pluggable
    MLflow->>Auth: Validate auth + workspace scope
    Auth-->>MLflow: Authorized

    Note right of MLflow: Decrypt provider API key<br/>(AESGCM envelope encryption,<br/>KEK via PBKDF2)

    MLflow->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>443/TCP, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Bearer {decrypted-api-key}
    LLM-->>MLflow: LLM Response (JSON)

    Note right of MLflow: Apply budget policies,<br/>rate limiting, guardrails

    MLflow-->>Client: Proxied LLM Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 3: Model Registry

    Client->>MLflow: POST /ajax-api/2.0/mlflow/registered-models/create<br/>Auth: SA Token, X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE
    MLflow->>Auth: Validate (requires EDIT permission)
    Auth-->>MLflow: Authorized
    MLflow->>DB: INSERT INTO registered_models<br/>(workspace-scoped)
    DB-->>MLflow: Model registered
    MLflow-->>Client: Model name + version
